# DDR 2ndMIX with beatmania IIDX CLUB VERSiON (System 573, analog I/O board): the first boot, from the install CD
# (MAME's "install" disc, 896jaa01; HIRAKU: --cd install). It asks for the Test button, then
# erases and fills the onboard flash, and says the install is complete: change the CD (by frame
# ~10800). MAME has no option to pick the disc: the oracle's rompath names the install disc as the
# runtime one for this step. Hashes the main RAM every frame and snapshots every 60 frames.
game ddr2mc

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 600 press "Service Mode" 8
from 0 every 60 snap
at 13200 quit
